    "Description": "## Changes\r\n\r\n## 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- feat(autodiscovery): support registry mappings for mirrored images @olblak (#11515)\r\n- feat(pyproject): Support cooldown and vulnerability for autodiscovery plugin @olblak (#10994)\r\n- feat(autodiscovery): per-track wait and \"_\" in variant pipeline IDs @olblak (#11495)\r\n- feat(autodiscovery): replace versionfilters with tracks @olblak (#11478)\r\n- feat(dockerimage): support age filtering @gionn (#11369)\r\n- feat(autodiscovery): label generated pipelines with their crawler and parent @olblak (#11470)\r\n- fix(git): allow an explicitly empty commit type @Purv-Kabaria (#11459)\r\n- feat(autodiscovery): add groups and versionfilters variants @olblak (#11465)\r\n- feat(pypi): Support Age @olblak (#10993)\r\n- feat(gitea/release): add changelog support @ldbs (#11283)\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- fix(github/action): discover nested Gitea/Forgejo workflows @ldbs (#11510)\r\n- fix(npm): never suggest a deprecated version @loispostula (#11511)\r\n- fix(bitbucket): don't parse an existing pull request body when spec.body is set @roulettedares (#11386)\r\n- fix(autodiscovery/dockerfile): use the image name in digest-only PR titles @ldbs (#11492)\r\n- fix(github/action): update Gitea/Forgejo pins when releases are disabled @ldbs (#11491)\r\n- fix(autodiscovery/dockerfile): pin target matcher to the resolved image reference @bfs2021 (#11467)\r\n- fix(version): report the platform running the binary @yuminn-k (#11430)\r\n- fix(autodiscovery): keep the Docker image tag filter with a versionfilter @olblak (#11429)\r\n\r\n## 🧰 Maintenance\r\n\r\n- deps(golang): Bump minor version for go.opentelemetry.io module @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11509)\r\n- chore(ci): upgrade uv version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11502)\r\n- deps(go): bump module gopkg.in/ini.v1 to v1.68.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11501)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/hashicorp/terraform-registry-address to v0.5.1 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11499)\r\n- chore(dockerfile): upgrade node version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11484)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/minamijoyo/tfupdate to v0.10.3 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11480)\r\n- deps(golang): Bump minor version for Golang module @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11461)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-go to v0.45.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11455)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/minamijoyo/hcledit to v0.2.19 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11453)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/moby/buildkit to v0.35.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11449)\r\n- chore(ci): upgrade uv version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11439)\r\n- feat(manifest): add a prek validation hook @ldbs (#11277)\r\n- chore(dockerfile): upgrade node version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11415)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/yuin/goldmark to v1.8.7 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11409)\r\n- install Updatecli gha workflows v0.124.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11394)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/drone/go-scm to v1.42.22 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11401)\r\n- deps: bump Updatecli GH action to v0.124.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#11378)\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n\r\n@bfs2021, @gionn, @ldbs, @loispostula, @olblak, @Purv-Kabaria, @roulettedares, @yuminn-k and [@updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot)\r\n\r\n## Sponsors\r\n\r\nIf Updatecli is useful to you, please consider sponsoring it.  \r\nYour support helps maintain and improve this project.\r\n\r\n[![GitHub stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/updatecli/updatecli?style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli) [![Sponsor](https://img.shields.io/badge/Sponsor-%E2%9D%A4-pink?style=for-the-badge)](https://www.updatecli.io/support/#sponsor-or-donate)",
